  Message:
    `@nlg:the` tags the wording on `over limit` as language `the`, but `over limit` has no other wording, no other wording in the module is in `the`, and no `@lang the` line declares it.
    A tag tells apart renderings of one rule in different languages. If `the` is the first word of the sentence, write `@nlg the …` with no colon. If the wording is in `the`, add `@lang the`, or give the rule a wording in another language.
